OL,3,GNEWSAMore people seek help for rental
OL,4,Adeposits
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe majority of people seeking help
OL,7,Fwith deposits for rental properties are
OL,8,Fthose aged between 55 and 59, a charity
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FChief Executive Officer of Citizens
OL,12,FAdvice Guernsey Alison Marquis said so
OL,13,Ffar this year, 11 people had asked the
OL,14,Fcharity for help and guidance about
OL,15,Faffording a deposit.
OL,17,F"It's possibly an area people wouldn't
OL,18,Fhave expected to be struggling," she
OL,19,Fsaid.
