OL,3,GNEWSAMore people seek help for rental
OL,4,Adeposits
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarquis said she welcomed the Guernsey
OL,7,FCommunity Savings' new and
OL,8,Finterest-free, Rental Deposit Scheme
OL,9,Fhelping islanders who can not afford
OL,10,Fthe upfront costs of securing a home in
OL,11,Fthe private rental market.
